      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1774934333121,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A pared down version of the left sidebar on the files tab, reuse all the connection and table choosing dialogs\nThis exists just to avoid work of porting all this one-time-use configuration to desktop client immediately,\ntransitions might be a little janky\nMay need to special-case something for oauth callbacks to know where to redirect to?",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A pared down version of the left sidebar on the files tab, reuse all the connection and table choosing dialogs\nThis exists just to avoid work of porting all this one-time-use configuration to desktop client immediately, transitions might be a little janky\nMay need to special-case something for oauth callbacks to know where to redirect to?",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
